GM CT! 🙏🏿

Back with another edition of Stew’s Deep Dive in AI sharing fresh opportunities, alpha, and what’s brewing in AI + crypto.

STEW’S DEEP DIVE INTO AI

=============

Web2 / General AI Highlights
@OpenAI introduces dots, powered by GPT-6 Astra. Always-on agents built to handle everything. https://t.co/OD2dxCbCmF

@OpenAI GPT-6.1 Sol is live. Near-Astra on coding and computer use at a lower cost. Cached input is $0.10 per million tokens. https://t.co/zk0mrVEzYQ

@claudeai launches Claude Sonnet 5.5. Clear upgrade over Sonnet 5, more than 30% faster, up to 30% cheaper. https://t.co/dbhWEN6K74

@GoogleDeepMind introduces Gemini 4 Argon. Built for coding, enterprise work, and cyber defense. 1M token output window. Rolling out to trusted testers via Fairwind. Governments get it first. https://t.co/pNVM1Rl4Aq

@OpenAI Ultrafast is live for GPT-6 Astra in Codex, ChatGPT Work, and the API. New Pro 500 plan is 25x Plus limits. https://t.co/m5p4RiRV3U

Meta’s Muse AI hits 5 million downloads, outpacing the early growth of ChatGPT, Grok, and Claude. https://t.co/sQzY41ECZa

@deepseek_ai ships DeepSeek Harness desktop for macOS and Windows. Linux via npm. https://t.co/NHB6h6wGLv

Anthropic is aiming to go public as early as mid-November so shares can trade before Thanksgiving. https://t.co/f9ujATMrYC

Web3 / DeAI Highlights
Ethereum Foundation and the Open Anonymity Project launch zkAPI. Pay for AI and metered APIs privately with zero-knowledge proofs. Live on Ethereum mainnet. https://t.co/KC2ajUPrqB

@solana : @nansen_ai hit a new ATH in x402 transactions per week. Solana settles more of those than every other network combined. https://t.co/kwU6yxDsj0

@RobinhoodApp Robinhood Agents are here. Spin one up in under a minute for analysis, strategy, and execution. Agent Apps included. Loops coming soon. https://t.co/RtCsbCXhDx

@circle : give your agent USDC by pasting one prompt into @Muse. Circle Agent Stack setup skill. https://t.co/xEmWoJpitU

@moonpay PayBox is now an official connector in Cursor and Grok. https://t.co/4l2mousWD2

Claude Sonnet 5.5, Opus 5.5, and Fable 5.1 are live on @NEARProtocol AI Cloud. One API key for all three. https://t.co/QotV6iStpm

@near_ai Copilot extension. Keep GitHub Copilot, swap the model to NEAR AI Cloud. TEE by default. https://t.co/hLYclMXo9g

@AskVenice Abliterated Large V2 is live. No refusals, no logs tied to you. Built for exploit analysis and red-team work. https://t.co/NK2vLEY67W

@MacrocosmosAI (Bittensor) announces iota SDK and Liquid Compute. Spare GPUs become one training cluster. https://t.co/eNbRmZlyYi

@chutes_ai trained an 8B model across distributed gaming GPUs for about $6,500. It runs on a phone CPU at nearly 60 tokens per second. https://t.co/MyArHoweIY

Funding Rounds
👉🏾 InstaCloud $8M is an agent-native serverless cloud for always-on AI agents. YC P26. Launched the same day as OpenAI DevDay.

👉🏾 @perptools $5M seed is a perpetuals DEX with AI trading agents and Orderly liquidity. Backed by Sfermion, Animoca, Shima, BigBrain, and NEAR Foundation.

That’s a wrap stay tuned for the next one!

@jun_song Well then when the AI bubbles will crash, make sure not to run back to them and buy their GPUs.
Buy from others like chinese makers.
If Moore threads sells a 64GB vram GPU I'll buy from them even if they're behind in raw compute power.
